BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

THE REGENT OF BELITUNG,

Considering : a. that discrimination and violence against women and children constitute violations of human rights and crimes against humanity, and are inconsistent with Pancasila and the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

b. that in order to fulfill the constitutional rights of women and children and to improve the quality of life of women and children is one of the mandatory affairs that constitutes the duty, authority, and responsibility of the Regional Government;

c. that violence against women and children in Belitung Regency tends to increase and expand, thus requiring integrated protection efforts;

d. that based on the considerations referred to in letters a, b, and c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation of Belitung Regency concerning Protection of Women's and Children's Rights from Acts of Violence;

